extends RefCounted
## English texts: The villagers grumble about the weather and take fright (see VillageWorries). Merged into Lang.EN (see Lang.PARTS).

const EN := {
	"Schon wieder Regen. Meine Stiefel werden nie mehr trocken.": "Rain again. My boots will never be dry.",
